<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq">VII.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">S</hi>I princeps Pa&#x017F;tor <hi rendition="#k">Christus</hi> gregis atque</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#et">fidelis,<lb/>
