<pb facs="#f0067" n="67"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Leichen-<hi rendition="#aq">Carmina.</hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq">IX.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#in">W</hi>Enn wu&#x0364;n&#x017F;chen was vermocht/ &#x017F;o ha&#x0364;tt&#x2019;<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">ich deinen Jahren/</hi></l><lb/>
