<fw type="header" place="top">Leichen-<hi rendition="#aq">Carmina.</hi></fw><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq">XII.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#in">S</hi>O gib&#x017F;t Du/ <hi rendition="#fr">theurer Mann,</hi> uns<lb/>
