<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq">XIV.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#in">W</hi>Je? will&#x017F;t du denn &#x017F;o fru&#x0364;h, <hi rendition="#fr">du theu-</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">rer Mann,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
